### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List Employees (with Pagination)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees?limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Employee by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create New Employee
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "employeeCode": "EMP-002",
    "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
    "phone": "+639123456789",
    "hireDate": "2024-02-01",
    "departmentId": 1,
    "designationId": 1,
    "branchId": 1,
    "status": "Active",
    "createUserAccount": true
}

###

### Update Employee
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "+639998887766"
}

###

### Delete Employee
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json
